.TH ARB 1
.SH NAME
arb \- {var}description{/var}
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B arb
.RI [command] " [options]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
{var}project.name{/var} is a deterministic recursive text compiler for structured generation.
.SH COMMON OPTIONS
.TP
.B --package
Package name or explicit filesystem path.
.TP
.B --data
Path to input YAML data file.
.TP
.B --out
Output directory.
.TP
.B --verbose
Enable verbose diagnostics.
.TP
.B --quiet
Suppress non-error output.
.SH COMMANDS
{rep}commands
.TP
.B {var}name{/var}
{var}summary{/var}
{if}examples
.RS
Examples:
{rep}examples
.br
{var}.{/var}
{/rep}
.RE
{/if}
{/rep}
.SH FILES
arb operates on:
- a package directory containing schema.yaml and templates/
- a YAML data file validated against the schema
- an output directory that receives generated files
.SH LICENSE
{var}project.license{/var}
